<title>DENMARK: BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-DANISH OPEN FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDELFART, Denmark 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Danish Open badminton finals on Sunday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Men's singles </p>
<p>3/4-Thomas Stuer-Lauridsen (Denmark) beat 3/4-Ong Ewe Hock (Malaysia) 6-15 15-7 15-12</p>
<p>Women's singles</p>
<p>Gong Zhichao (China) beat Marina Andrevskaya (Sweden) 12-11 11-4</p>
<p>Men's doubles:</p>
<p>Thomas Stavngaard/Jim Laugesen (Denmark) beat 2-Simon Archer/ Chris Hunt (England) 17-15 10-15 15-7</p>
<p>Women's doubles:</p>
<p>1-Helene Kirkegaard/Rikke Olsen (Denmark) beat 3/4-Julie Bradbury/Joanne Goode (England) 15-6 15-2</p>
</text>
